{"2938360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deaths Circuit", "steam_appid": 2938360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount your diesel fueled war horse, become a circuit rider and enter Deaths Circuit.<br>A fully 3D HDR-rendered post-apocalyptic world in a classic isometric view loaded with combat and racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procure war machines, weaponry, and sacred components from the vendor to bolster your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain holy destruction upon your enemies with a mighty array of armaments—cleanse, purge, butcher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain the machine spirit’s favor through repairs and reverent maintenance—neglect invites decay and failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept missions decreed by higher powers and earn glorious rewards. The unworthy shall find no reprieve—only death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve greatness and leave no heretic alive in your path to dominance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge alliances or invoke rivalries amidst the ever-shifting tides of loyalty and treachery. Trust is fleeting, betrayal inevitable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in the deadly art of sabotage and espionage—each shadow hides a threat and every secret uncovered invites judgment swift and merciless.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount your diesel fueled war horse, become a circuit rider and enter Deaths Circuit.<br>A fully 3D HDR-rendered post-apocalyptic world in a classic isometric view loaded with combat and racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procure war machines, weaponry, and sacred components from the vendor to bolster your arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain holy destruction upon your enemies with a mighty array of armaments—cleanse, purge, butcher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain the machine spirit’s favor through repairs and reverent maintenance—neglect invites decay and failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept missions decreed by higher powers and earn glorious rewards. The unworthy shall find no reprieve—only death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve greatness and leave no heretic alive in your path to dominance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge alliances or invoke rivalries amidst the ever-shifting tides of loyalty and treachery. Trust is fleeting, betrayal inevitable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in the deadly art of sabotage and espionage—each shadow hides a threat and every secret uncovered invites judgment swift and merciless.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Mount your diesel fueled war horse, become a circuit rider and enter Deaths Circuit. A fully 3D HDR-rendered post-apocalyptic world in a classic isometric view loaded with combat racing.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938360/header.jpg?t=1783376787", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783376787", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783376787", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit OS required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 2.8 GHz/AMD Phenom II X4 945 3.0 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 550 Ti 2GB/AMD Radeo